非实现者金额77项双Node通过；材料与完整证据由依赖本PR的PR46保存。\n- 前一精确b0a9554的CI39155201166失败，唯一失败为重复信号清理中的旧端口可连接断言；后续HTTP/OCR跳过，artifact实际0。原日志缺少端口归属，根因不能被确定为进程泄漏或复用。\n- 此提交仅修该测试观测协议，按原连接和原PGID判断；受控无关监听器重占旧端口的同一夹具旧断言0P1F→身份判定1P0F。原8加新1在Node24共9P0F，非实现者Node26新增目标1P0F；应用runner/helper未改。\n- 当前精确CI：[39156365623](https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/actions/runs/39156365623)，正在执行，尚不能记为通过。\n\n## 交付边界\n\n原始输出、拒收、历史失败、历次冻结结果与人工核对机制继续保留。PR46对同一批首轮回答另存v27复评，没有新模型调用、训练或生产部署。尚未获本轮PR45/46合并授权；人工业务验收未完成。\n","created_at":"2026-10-18T03:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T18:56:24Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7fb6fc183cf48692d70b73d24236ad31baa2ea7a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/issues/45/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/statuses/d963425ef16831768395ba6a233df272dbaee196","head":{"label":"ZZZZihan:feature/material-facts-v7-guards","ref":"feature/material-facts-v7-guards","sha":"d963425ef16831768395ba6a233df272dbaee196","user":{"login":"ZZZZihan","id":113167863,"node_id":"U_kgDOBr7N9w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113167863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan